找个理由。听起来你有点怕，连自己的情绪都要被拿去和“有没有好好学习”比较。那这种难受，最近大概是什么时候会冒出来？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"说不清楚也没关系，难受本身就是真实的，不用先给它找个理由。听起来你有点怕，连自己的情绪都要被拿去和“有没有好好学习”比较。那这种难受，最近大概是什么时候会冒出来？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1621,"promptTokens":1888,"completionTokens":111,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:22:59"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":9,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574281037604508,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67483f4429d1fd72f7575","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536579999,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:22:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67483f4429d1fd72f7575","chatId":"d0f43a99f1cc44d6b416e184eb08f230","sessionId":null,"userId":99842,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……那还好。其实我也不是怕他们知道什么，就是……他们要是知道了，肯定又要说我心思没放在学习上吧。我也不太清楚自己为什么会这么难受，说不太清楚。<第4轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":8,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574281037604508,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":4,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":3,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af67483f4429d1fd72f7576","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536579996,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:22:59","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67480f4429d1fd72f756e","chatId":"d0f43a99f1cc44d6b416e184eb08f230","sessionId":null,"userId":99842,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"会保密的，你说的话我不会随便告诉别人，这是基本的原则。不过有一种情况例外——如果你提到自己或别人正处在危险里，我需要找能帮上忙的大人一起处理。这样说是想让你安心些。你担心的，是爸妈知道后会有什么反应吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"会保密的，你说的话我不会随便告诉别人，这是基本的原则。不过有一种情况例外——如果你提到自己或别人正处在危险里，我需要找能帮上忙的大人一起处理。这样说是想让你安心些。你担心的，是爸妈知道后会有什么反应吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2000,"promptTokens":1748,"completionTokens":99,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:22:56"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":7,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.014060004399652742,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67480f4429d1fd72f756d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536576431,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:22:56","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67480f4429d1fd72f756d","chatId":"d0f43a99f1cc44d6b416e184eb08f230","sessionId":null,"userId":99842,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"没有，没怎么做过这种……我也不知道该说到什么程度。那个，我想问一下，我在这儿说的话，会被告诉别人吗？比如我爸妈或者老师？<第3轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoC